cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use pyHelioFITS in your research, please cite the version you used.
  Each release has its own Zenodo DOI once the Zenodo integration has archived it.
type: software
title: pyHelioFITS
version: 0.1.0
abstract: >-
  pyHelioFITS is the Python side of the HelioFITS Suite, installed as the
  pyheliofits package. It holds HelioFITS Core (the hfcore solar-data library:
  find data, download it and keep it in one indexed library), a client for a
  running HelioFITS Studio, the library's cache verbs for scripts and
  notebooks, a reader and replayer for Studio's export records (hfrecord), and
  an MCP server (heliofits-mcp) that exposes them to an LLM client.
authors:
